{"id":49966,"date":"2026-03-14T20:16:13","date_gmt":"2026-03-14T19:16:13","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=49966"},"modified":"2026-09-23T15:15:06","modified_gmt":"2026-09-23T14:15:06","slug":"azores-hybrid-race","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/azores-hybrid-race\/","title":{"rendered":"Azores Hybrid Race 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Azores Hybrid Race 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Azores Hybrid Race 2026<\/strong> \u00e9 a grande competi\u00e7\u00e3o de fitness de corrida h\u00edbrida no arquip\u00e9lago dos <strong>A\u00e7ores<\/strong>, decorrendo no emblem\u00e1tico recinto das <strong>Portas do Mar<\/strong> em <strong>Ponta Delgada<\/strong> nos dias 17 e 18 de outubro. Organizado pelo clube <strong>Ilh\u00e9us Impactantes<\/strong>, o evento adota rigorosamente as regras e standards competitivos internacionais do formato HYROX, aliando resist\u00eancia cardiovascular a pura for\u00e7a funcional num cen\u00e1rio mar\u00edtimo \u00edmpar.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">A competi\u00e7\u00e3o desafia os atletas ao cumprimento de <strong>8 km de corrida (8 fra\u00e7\u00f5es de 1 km)<\/strong> intercalados com <strong>8 esta\u00e7\u00f5es funcionais<\/strong> de elevada intensidade: SkiErg (1000 m), Sled Push (50 m), Sled Pull (50 m), Burpee Broad Jumps (80 m), Remo (1000 m), Farmer Carry (200 m), Sandbag Lunges (100 m) e Wall Balls. Com categorias individuais (Open e Pro), Duplas e Estafetas Relay em tempo cont\u00ednuo com cronometragem oficial por chip, a prova premeia a consist\u00eancia e capacidade atl\u00e9tica global.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">17 e 18 de outubro de 2026<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: